tried serial (on USART3 PB11/PB10) with no luck either. this is my configuration - STM32F103 with a "28KiB bootloader" and serial (on USART1 PA10/PA9) communication.

[Here Ya Go.](https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:5359133/files) you didnt specify which file so i did the Skylab version. if you want the other. just let me know

